    ELSE IF NOT `the model is a general-purpose AI model`
         THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the Article is about authorised representatives of providers of general-purpose AI models
         ELSE JUST `the mandate empowers the authorised representative to be addressed, in addition to or instead of the provider, by the AI Office or the competent authorities, on all issues related to ensuring compliance with this Regulation`
